OL,3,AEx-Britain First leader arrested in HMO
OL,4,Aattacks investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former co-leader of the far-right
OL,7,FBritain First party has said she was
OL,8,Farrested as part of an investigation
OL,9,Finto attacks on houses in multiple
OL,10,Foccupation (HMOs).
OL,12,FIn a post on X, Ashlea Simon said she
OL,13,Fhad been held at Manchester Airport
OL,14,Fafter "returning from a family
OL,15,Fholiday".
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said a
OL,18,F37-year-old woman had been arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of "conspiracy to cause
OL,20,Fcriminal damage", following a spate of
OL,21,Fincidents in which HMOs were vandalised
OL,22,Facross the Greater Manchester region.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
