OL,3,AEx-Britain First leader arrested in HMO
OL,4,Aattacks investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon, who said in her post that she
OL,7,F"hasn't committed a crime in her life",
OL,8,Fwas approached for comment by the Local
OL,9,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS).
